SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                10000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  5000
NumberOfEquilibrationCycles   1000
PrintEvery                    1000
PrintPropertiesEvery          1000

Forcefield                    local
CutOff                        14.0

ExternalTemperature           298.0
ExternalPressure              100000.0

Framework 0
FrameworkName                 framework
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes
HeliumVoidFraction            0.4886
UnitCells                     2 2 2

Component 0 MoleculeName             ethane
            MoleculeDefinition       local
            TranslationProbability   1.0
            RotationProbability      1.0
            ReinsertionProbability   1.0
            SwapProbability          1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules  0

Movies                        yes
WriteMoviesEvery              1000

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
WriteEnergyHistogramEvery     1000

ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes
WriteNumberOfMoleculesHistogramEvery 1000